# Project Title: Prime Number + Guessing Game

## Description

There are two scripts in this folder. 
1. prime_num_excercise.py --> This code will tell you if the number entered is a prime number or not.
2. Number_guessing_game.py --> This code is used to play a number guessing game where the user gets to guess the number picked by the computer. 


### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the Calculator. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

### Installations Needed

NA

